&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:22.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:22.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRetirementBenefitsConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesShareOptionsEtcConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:18pt;"&gt;(ストック・オプション等関係)&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:5pt;font-size:5pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesShareOptionsEtcConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesTaxEffectAccountingConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:18pt;"&gt;(税効果会計関係)&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;１．繰延税金資産及び繰延税金負債の発生の主な原因別の内訳&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:30.1pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:454.5pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:240pt;min-width:240pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:42.8pt;min-width:42.8pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:61.5pt;min-width:61.5pt;"/&gt;
